Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.95,0:00:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuntsun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(124.8,248.533)}「Fascinating Peperoncino, datsun!」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.47,0:00:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,have you decided what to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.91,0:00:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, what should I get, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.39,0:00:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuntsun, this is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eating with your dad-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun even with someone who \Nisn't family mixed in, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.89,0:00:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, Squid, are you working part-time here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, as a gig job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you decided on your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have the peperoncino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll have that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating your order:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,peperoncino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, wasn't where you cut that weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It smelled like {\i1}Hallyu{\i0}, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192.8,30.933)}Hallyu = refers to the global popularity and spread of South Korea's cultural economy, exporting pop culture, entertainment, music, TV dramas, and movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallyu? \NWhat kind of nonsense...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating your order: peperon... cino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, where you cut it is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The space in pe-peroncino is way too wide, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it's peperoncino right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pe-pe-pe-peronchi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Kikkun end up saying it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, if I may say so, \Nit's not peperonchi, it's peperoncino!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that! It's peperoncino, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not peperonchi either, \Nit's peperoncino!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs25\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(200.8,107.733)}Several hours later...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating your order...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you stop repeating it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my pride as a gig-work leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating your order...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pe-pe-peroncino! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You added one too many "peperon" again, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A gig-work leader would never say one too many "peperon".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did that, during the digital closing...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,the number of... peperons...hahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating your order: pe-pe-pe-pe-pe-pe-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Overheated!
